# Modelfile for the fine-tuned phishing binary classifier.
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Place this file in the SAME folder as your GGUF file.
#      The weights are NOT committed to the repo (2GB) — this file only
#      describes how Ollama should serve them.
#   2. From that folder, run:  ollama create phishing-binary -f Modelfile
#
# NOTE: the TEMPLATE below is the exact prompt format the model was
# served with. The PARAMETER lines are sensible defaults for a
# classifier — adjust or drop them if your setup used different values.

FROM ./phishing-binary-q4.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048

TEMPLATE """### Instruction:
Classify this email as malicious or safe.

### Input:
{{ .Prompt }}

### Response:"""
